<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Tennessee Fifth 2027 Calendar</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,500;0,600;0,700;1,600&family=Source+Serif+4:opsz,wght@8..60,400;8..60,600&family=Jost:wght@400;500;600&display=swap">
<style>
  :root{
    --bg:#F7F1E2;
    --paper:#FFFDF7;
    --paper-line:#E7D9B8;
    --ink:#2B2033;
    --ink-soft:#6A5D71;
    --purple:#4A1D63;
    --purple-deep:#241035;
    --purple-tint:#EFE6EF;
    --gold:#A97524;
    --gold-soft:#EBDAAE;
    --gold-line:#CBA34C;
    --rose:#823A54;
    --rose-tint:#F3E4E7;
    --teal:#2E6E62;
    --teal-tint:#E2EEEA;
    --navy:#213A5C;
    --navy-tint:#E5E9EF;
    --slate:#53606E;
    --slate-tint:#E9ECEF;
    --shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(36,16,53,0.06), 0 6px 18px rgba(36,16,53,0.06);
  }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark){
    :root:not([data-theme="light"]){
      --bg:#1A1120; --paper:#241730; --paper-line:#3B2A45; --ink:#F3ECEF; --ink-soft:#C4B4C9;
      --purple:#B98FD1; --purple-deep:#120A18; --purple-tint:#2E1F39;
      --gold:#E3BB63; --gold-soft:#3A2E22; --gold-line:#8A6A2E;
      --rose:#E2A4B7; --rose-tint:#3A2530;
      --teal:#7FC4B6; --teal-tint:#1E312D;
      --navy:#9FB4D4; --navy-tint:#1C2735;
      --slate:#B7C0C9; --slate-tint:#2A2F35;
      --shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.35), 0 8px 22px rgba(0,0,0,0.35);
    }
  }
  :root[data-theme="dark"]{
    --bg:#1A1120; --paper:#241730; --paper-line:#3B2A45; --ink:#F3ECEF; --ink-soft:#C4B4C9;
    --purple:#B98FD1; --purple-deep:#120A18; --purple-tint:#2E1F39;
    --gold:#E3BB63; --gold-soft:#3A2E22; --gold-line:#8A6A2E;
    --rose:#E2A4B7; --rose-tint:#3A2530;
    --teal:#7FC4B6; --teal-tint:#1E312D;
    --navy:#9FB4D4; --navy-tint:#1C2735;
    --slate:#B7C0C9; --slate-tint:#2A2F35;
    --shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.35), 0 8px 22px rgba(0,0,0,0.35);
  }

  *{box-sizing:border-box;}
  body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font-family:"Source Serif 4", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;}
  .wrap{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 20px 44px;}
  a{color:inherit;}

  .hero{position:relative;width:100%;overflow:hidden;background:var(--purple-deep);}
  .hero img{width:100%;display:block;}
  .hero::after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(18,10,24,0) 62%, rgba(18,10,24,0.6) 100%);}
  .sr-only{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;padding:0;margin:-1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0,0,0,0);white-space:nowrap;border:0;}

  .masthead{background:linear-gradient(180deg, var(--purple-deep), var(--purple) 140%);color:#F4EAF6;padding:30px 20px 26px;}
  .masthead-inner{max-width:1140px;margin:0 auto;text-align:center;}
  .eyebrow{font-family:"Jost", sans-serif;font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gold-soft);font-weight:600;}
  .eyebrow.small{opacity:.9;margin-top:6px;}
  h1{font-family:"Cormorant Garamond", Georgia, serif;font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(32px, 4.6vw, 50px);line-height:1.05;margin:8px 0 6px;text-wrap:balance;color:#FBF4E8;}
  .masthead .theme{font-family:"Cormorant Garamond", serif;font-style:italic;font-weight:600;font-size:21px;color:#F3DFA8;margin:2px 0 4px;}
  .masthead .tagline{font-family:"Jost",sans-serif;font-size:11.5px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#E4D3E8;}
  .masthead .scripture{font-family:"Jost",sans-serif;font-size:11px;color:#CDB7D3;margin-top:4px;letter-spacing:.03em;}
  .divider-orn{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:12px;margin:14px auto 6px;max-width:320px;color:var(--gold);}
  .divider-orn .ln{height:1px;flex:1;background:linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--gold-line), transparent);}

  .note-bar{background:var(--gold-soft);border-top:1px solid var(--gold-line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--gold-line);}
  .note-bar p{max-width:1140px;margin:0 auto;padding:10px 20px;font-family:"Jost", sans-serif;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--ink);text-align:center;letter-spacing:.01em;}

  .quicknav{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;justify-content:center;padding:18px 0 2px;}
  .quicknav a{font-family:"Jost",sans-serif;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.04em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--purple);background:var(--purple-tint);border:1px solid var(--gold-line);border-radius:14px;padding:4px 11px;text-decoration:none;scroll-margin-top:14px;}
  :root[data-theme="dark"] .quicknav a{color:var(--gold);}
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark){:root:not([data-theme="light"]) .quicknav a{color:var(--gold);}}

  .nextup{max-width:620px;margin:16px auto 0;text-align:center;font-family:"Jost",sans-serif;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--ink-soft);}
  .nextup strong{color:var(--rose);}

  .legend{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px 18px;justify-content:center;padding:14px 0 4px;}
  .legend-item{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;font-family:"Jost", sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-soft);letter-spacing:.02em;}
  .swatch{width:11px;height:11px;border-radius:3px;display:inline-block;}
  .swatch.conf{background:var(--purple);}
  .swatch.assembly{background:var(--gold);}
  .swatch.mpc{background:var(--rose);opacity:.6;}
  .swatch.special{background:var(--rose);}
  .swatch.council{background:var(--teal);}
  .swatch.custom{background:var(--slate);}

  h2.section-title{font-family:"Cormorant Garamond", serif;font-weight:700;font-size:26px;margin:36px 0 4px;color:var(--purple);text-align:center;}
  :root[data-theme="dark"] h2.section-title{color:var(--gold);}
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark){:root:not([data-theme="light"]) h2.section-title{color:var(--gold);}}
  p.section-sub{text-align:center;font-family:"Jost",sans-serif;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--ink-soft);margin:0 0 16px;font-style:italic;}

  .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3, 1fr);gap:18px;margin-top:10px;}
  @media (max-width:900px){.grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2, 1fr);}}
  @media (max-width:560px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;} .wrap{padding:0 14px 36px;} .month{padding:14px 14px 12px;} .band{padding:16px 16px;} .aux{padding:18px 16px;}}

  .month{background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--paper-line);border-radius:10px;padding:16px 16px 14px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);scroll-margin-top:14px;}
  .month-name{font-family:"Cormorant Garamond", serif;font-weight:700;font-size:22px;margin:0 0 10px;color:var(--purple);border-bottom:1px solid var(--gold-line);padding-bottom:8px;letter-spacing:.01em;}
  :root[data-theme="dark"] .month-name{color:var(--gold);}
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark){:root:not([data-theme="light"]) .month-name{color:var(--gold);}}

  .ev-list{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:11px;}
  .ev{display:grid;grid-template-columns:54px 1fr;grid-template-areas:"date body" "date tags";column-gap:11px;row-gap:4px;padding-bottom:11px;border-bottom:1px dashed var(--paper-line);position:relative;}
  .ev:last-child{border-bottom:none;padding-bottom:0;}
  .ev.is-next{background:linear-gradient(90deg, var(--gold-soft), transparent 70%);margin:0 -8px;padding:8px 8px 11px;border-radius:8px;}
  .ev-date{grid-area:date;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;}
  .ev-day{font-family:"Jost",sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:13.5px;color:var(--ink);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;line-height:1.15;}
  .ev-dow{font-family:"Jost",sans-serif;font-size:10px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;color:var(--ink-soft);}
  .ev-body{grid-area:body;}
  .ev-title{font-weight:600;font-size:14px;line-height:1.3;color:var(--ink);}
  .flag{font-family:"Jost",sans-serif;font-size:9px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.05em;color:var(--rose);border:1px solid var(--rose);border-radius:8px;padding:1px 5px;margin-left:5px;cursor:help;vertical-align:1px;white-space:nowrap;}
  .ev-sub{display:block;font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-soft);font-style:italic;margin-top:1px;}
  .ev-time{grid-area:tags;font-family:"Jost",sans-serif;font-size:11px;color:var(--ink-soft);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;}
  .ev-tag{grid-area:tags;justify-self:end;font-family:"Jost",sans-serif;font-size:9.5px;letter-spacing:.03em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:2px 7px;border-radius:20px;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap;}
  .tag-conf{background:var(--purple-tint);color:var(--purple);}
  .tag-assembly{background:var(--gold-soft);color:var(--gold);border:1px solid var(--gold-line);}
  .tag-mpc{background:var(--rose-tint);color:var(--rose);}
  .tag-special{background:var(--rose);color:#FFF7F4;}
  .tag-council{background:var(--teal-tint);color:var(--teal);}
  .tag-general{background:var(--slate-tint);color:var(--slate);}
  .nextbadge{position:absolute;top:-8px;right:0;background:var(--rose);color:#fff;font-family:"Jost",sans-serif;font-size:8.5px;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:2px 7px;border-radius:10px;}

  .ev-del{display:none;flex-shrink:0;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:50%;border:1px solid var(--rose);background:transparent;color:var(--rose);font-size:12px;line-height:1;cursor:pointer;padding:0;margin-left:6px;}
  .ev-del:hover{background:var(--rose);color:#fff;}
  body.committee-mode .ev-del{display:inline-flex;}
  body.committee-mode .ev-time{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;}
  .committee-banner{display:none;max-width:620px;margin:10px auto 0;text-align:center;font-family:"Jost",sans-serif;font-size:11.5px;color:var(--teal);letter-spacing:.04em;text-transform:uppercase;}
  body.committee-mode .committee-banner{display:block;}

  .band{margin-top:14px;background:var(--navy-tint);border:1px solid var(--gold-line);border-radius:10px;padding:20px 24px;}
  .band h3{font-family:"Cormorant Garamond",serif;font-size:19px;margin:0 0 10px;color:var(--navy);}
  :root[data-theme="dark"] .band h3{color:var(--gold);}
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark){:root:not([data-theme="light"]) .band h3{color:var(--gold);}}
  .band ul{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:10px 20px;}
  @media (max-width:760px){.band ul{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);}}
  @media (max-width:520px){.band ul{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}
  .band li{font-size:13.5px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:space-between;gap:4px 10px;border-bottom:1px dotted var(--paper-line);padding-bottom:6px;}
  .band li .d{font-family:"Jost",sans-serif;font-size:11.5px;color:var(--ink-soft);white-space:nowrap;}

  .districts{margin-top:14px;overflow-x:auto;border:1px solid var(--paper-line);border-radius:10px;background:var(--paper);box-shadow:var(--shadow);}
  table.dtable{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:13.5px;min-width:560px;}
  table.dtable th{font-family:"Jost",sans-serif;font-size:10.5px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;color:var(--ink-soft);text-align:left;padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--gold-line);background:var(--purple-tint);}
  table.dtable td{padding:9px 14px;border-bottom:1px dotted var(--paper-line);vertical-align:top;}
  table.dtable tr:last-child td{border-bottom:none;}
  table.dtable td.dist-name{font-weight:600;color:var(--purple);}
  :root[data-theme="dark"] table.dtable td.dist-name{color:var(--gold);}
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark){:root:not([data-theme="light"]) table.dtable td.dist-name{color:var(--gold);}}

  .theme-block{margin-top:30px;text-align:center;padding:26px 20px;background:linear-gradient(180deg, var(--purple-tint), transparent);border-radius:12px;}
  .theme-block .tline{font-family:"Cormorant Garamond",serif;font-weight:700;font-size:28px;color:var(--purple);text-wrap:balance;}
  :root[data-theme="dark"] .theme-block .tline{color:var(--gold);}
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark){:root:not([data-theme="light"]) .theme-block .tline{color:var(--gold);}}
  .theme-block .ttag{font-family:"Jost",sans-serif;font-size:11.5px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--rose);margin-top:6px;}
  .theme-block .tscripture{font-family:"Jost",sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-soft);margin-top:8px;}

  .aux{margin-top:30px;background:var(--purple-tint);border:1px solid var(--gold-line);border-radius:10px;padding:22px 26px;}
  .aux h2{font-family:"Cormorant Garamond", serif;font-size:21px;margin:0 0 4px;color:var(--purple);}
  :root[data-theme="dark"] .aux h2{color:var(--gold);}
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark){:root:not([data-theme="light"]) .aux h2{color:var(--gold);}}
  .aux p.lead{margin:0 0 12px;font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-soft);font-style:italic;}
  .aux ul{margin:0;padding:0;list-style:none;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;}
  .aux li{font-size:13.5px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:space-between;gap:4px 10px;border-bottom:1px dotted var(--paper-line);padding-bottom:6px;}

  /* Committee update panel */
  .update{margin-top:30px;border:1px solid var(--paper-line);border-radius:10px;background:var(--paper);box-shadow:var(--shadow);overflow:hidden;}
  .update summary{cursor:pointer;list-style:none;padding:14px 18px;font-family:"Jost",sans-serif;font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.04em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink-soft);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;}
  .update summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none;}
  .update summary::before{content:"\1F512";font-size:13px;}
  .update[open] summary::before{content:"\1F513";}
  .update-body{padding:4px 18px 20px;border-top:1px solid var(--paper-line);}
  .update-body label{display:block;font-family:"Jost",sans-serif;font-size:11px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.05em;color:var(--ink-soft);margin:10px 0 4px;}
  .update-body input, .update-body select, .update-body textarea{width:100%;font-family:"Source Serif 4",serif;font-size:14px;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid var(--paper-line);border-radius:6px;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);}
  .update-body textarea{resize:vertical;min-height:50px;}
  .update-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;}
  @media (max-width:520px){.update-row{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}
  .update-btn{margin-top:14px;font-family:"Jost",sans-serif;font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.04em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:600;background:var(--purple);color:#fff;border:none;border-radius:20px;padding:9px 20px;cursor:pointer;}
  .update-btn:hover{opacity:.9;}
  .update-hint{font-family:"Jost",sans-serif;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--ink-soft);margin:6px 0 14px;line-height:1.5;}
  .update-hint strong{color:var(--teal);}
  #f-kind-new{margin-top:8px;}
  .update-msg{font-family:"Jost",sans-serif;font-size:12px;margin-top:10px;min-height:14px;}
  .update-msg.err{color:var(--rose);}
  .update-msg.ok{color:var(--teal);}
  .added-list{margin-top:16px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;}
  .added-item{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;font-size:13px;border-bottom:1px dotted var(--paper-line);padding-bottom:6px;}
  .added-item .rm{background:none;border:none;color:var(--ink-soft);cursor:pointer;font-size:11px;text-decoration:underline;}

  .printhint{text-align:center;font-family:"Jost",sans-serif;font-size:11px;color:var(--ink-soft);margin-top:26px;}

  footer{margin-top:22px;padding-top:22px;border-top:1px solid var(--paper-line);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-end;gap:24px;flex-wrap:wrap;}
  .foot-info{font-family:"Jost", sans-serif;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--ink-soft);line-height:1.7;}
  .foot-info strong{color:var(--ink);font-weight:600;}
  .foot-info .org{font-family:"Cormorant Garamond", serif;font-weight:700;font-size:16.5px;color:var(--purple);display:block;margin-bottom:4px;}
  :root[data-theme="dark"] .foot-info .org{color:var(--gold);}
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark){:root:not([data-theme="light"]) .foot-info .org{color:var(--gold);}}
  .foot-logo{flex-shrink:0;margin-left:auto;text-align:right;}
  .foot-logo img{width:64px;height:auto;display:block;margin-left:auto;}
  .foot-logo .cap{font-family:"Jost",sans-serif;font-size:9.5px;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink-soft);margin-top:6px;}

  .foot-qr{flex-shrink:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:6px;}
  .foot-qr .qr-box{background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid var(--gold-line);border-radius:8px;padding:8px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);line-height:0;}
  .foot-qr canvas{display:block;width:104px;height:104px;}
  .foot-qr .qr-cap{font-family:"Jost",sans-serif;font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.03em;color:var(--ink-soft);text-align:center;}
  .foot-qr .qr-url{font-weight:600;color:var(--purple);}
  :root[data-theme="dark"] .foot-qr .qr-url{color:var(--gold);}
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark){:root:not([data-theme="light"]) .foot-qr .qr-url{color:var(--gold);}}
  .foot-qr .qr-dl{font-family:"Jost",sans-serif;font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.03em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--purple);background:none;border:1px solid var(--purple);border-radius:14px;padding:3px 10px;cursor:pointer;}
  :root[data-theme="dark"] .foot-qr .qr-dl{color:var(--gold);border-color:var(--gold);}
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark){:root:not([data-theme="light"]) .foot-qr .qr-dl{color:var(--gold);border-color:var(--gold);}}
  .foot-qr .qr-dl:hover{background:var(--purple-tint);}

  @media (max-width:560px){footer{justify-content:center;text-align:center;}.foot-logo{margin:0 auto;text-align:center;}.foot-logo img{margin:0 auto;}}

  @media print{
    .hero::after, .quicknav, .update, .printhint{display:none;}
    body{background:#fff;}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="hero">
  <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Tennessee Fifth members processing toward the jurisdiction's house of worship — Determination, Working Together, God's Glory">
</div>

<h1 class="sr-only">Tennessee Fifth Ecclesiastical Jurisdiction &mdash; 2027 Jurisdictional Calendar</h1>

<div class="note-bar">
  <p>Calendar dates are subject to change at the behest of the Prelate. Compiled from the Office of the Jurisdictional Secretary, the Women&rsquo;s Department, the District Superintendents and the 2027 Calendar Agenda, November 2026. Items marked <span class="flag" style="margin-left:0;">verify</span> show a difference between two sources and should be confirmed with the committee.</p>
</div>

<div class="wrap">

  <nav class="quicknav" aria-label="Jump to month">
<a href="#m-jan">Jan</a>
    <a href="#m-feb">Feb</a>
    <a href="#m-mar">Mar</a>
    <a href="#m-apr">Apr</a>
    <a href="#m-may">May</a>
    <a href="#m-jun">Jun</a>
    <a href="#m-jul">Jul</a>
    <a href="#m-aug">Aug</a>
    <a href="#m-sep">Sep</a>
    <a href="#m-oct">Oct</a>
    <a href="#m-nov">Nov</a>
    <a href="#m-dec">Dec</a>
  </nav>

  <p class="nextup" id="nextup"></p>
  <p class="committee-banner">Committee mode unlocked &mdash; click the &times; beside any date to remove it</p>

  <div class="legend">
    <span class="legend-item"><span class="swatch assembly"></span>Jurisdictional Assembly</span>
    <span class="legend-item"><span class="swatch conf"></span>Leadership Conference / Prayer Line</span>
    <span class="legend-item"><span class="swatch council"></span>Pastor &amp; Elders Council</span>
    <span class="legend-item"><span class="swatch mpc"></span>Midnight Prayer Cry</span>
    <span class="legend-item"><span class="swatch special"></span>Special / Convention</span>
  </div>

  <div class="grid" id="monthgrid">
<article class="month" id="m-jan">
          <h3 class="month-name">January</h3>
          <ul class="ev-list">
            <li class="ev ev-conf" data-date="2027-01-09" data-id="jan-0">
              <span class="ev-date"><span class="ev-day">Jan 9</span><span class="ev-dow">Sat</span></span>
              <span class="ev-body">
                <span class="ev-title">Jurisdictional Leadership Conference</span>
                <span class="ev-sub">In Person</span>
              </span>
              <span class="ev-time">9:00 AM<button class="ev-del" type="button" data-id="jan-0" data-kind="static" title="Remove this date">&times;</button></span>
